---
# Tests check an optional with a Catch2 REQUIRE before reading it; clang-tidy can't see that REQUIRE stops the test.
# A test case with many SECTIONs and REQUIREs scores high on cognitive complexity without being hard to read.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-bugprone-unchecked-optional-access,-readability-function-cognitive-complexity'
